Package: homerViz
Title: Visualization tools for HOMER motif enrichment results
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Christophe", "Tav",
    email = "christophe.tav@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8808-9617"))
Description: Simplifies exploration of HOMER motif enrichment results by
    parsing findMotifsGenome.pl output directories into tidy data frames.
    Generates dot plots, scatter plots, and motif logo panels for known and
    de novo motifs, as well as interactive HTML reports with sortable tables
    and embedded logos. Supports ChIP-seq, ATAC-seq, and other genomic
    assays using HOMER for motif discovery.
